Statues take up space and weight a lot.  They are good for hitting with
pick-axes and often contain spellbooks .(stone golems, when killed, become
statues.  I think they have a higher chance of containing spellbooks(I have
killed about 60 of them this game and 30 or so of them contained spellbooks)

Yes, but beware that if you drop water on an altar, it will become the same as
the altar.  i.e. water becomes holy water on a lawful altar.  

Well, Rob says 'no, I am pretty sure not' but I don't really know.  Perhaps
the bigger ones do more good, but I don't know.  I think that other unicorn
types may be better, but that is just a guess...

